SUMMARY:Pre-Memorial Day Franks & Dranks on the Roof
DESCRIPTION:The long weekend starts here. Join us Sunday\, May 24th\, from 1-10 PM on the Roof for hot dogs\, cold drinks\, and downtown Durham views on the Sunday before Memorial Day. \nOrder a Wagyu beef frank from your server or bartender and redeem it at our self-serve topping bar. \nWhat to Expect \n🌭 Wagyu Beef Hotdog Bar | $10 | Order from your server or bartender\, then hit the self-serve topping bar: pickled ramp relish\, house-made coleslaw\, three mustards\, ketchup\, and onions. Add house-made beef chili for $2. \n🍔 Black Bean Burger | $14 | Fig\, pepper jelly\, gruyère\, arugula. \n🥗 Sides | $5 | Pasta salad (vegan) · Potato salad (GF) · Old Bay chips · Lentil salad (vegan + GF) \n🍾 Build-Your-Own Spritz menu available alongside the full bar. \nNot a hot dog person? A limited selection from the regular Roof menu is available. No reservations required. Come hungry.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/pre-memorial-day-franks-dranks-on-the-roof/
LOCATION:The Durham Hotel\, 315 E Chapel Hill Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink,Holiday,Wines, Spirits, Beer and Cheer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Franks-Dranks-2026.jpg
