SUMMARY:BEERthoven: The Durham Fellows
DESCRIPTION:You know them. You love them. The Durham Fellows are back. Talented\, hilarious\, and crackling with chemistry. \nLock in with them! A thoughtfully curated program\, revealed in the moment.  We’ll see you there for some string quartet brilliance in the Atomic Clock Taproom. As always\, bring your presence—and maybe a bit of trivia brain. \nAll pay-what-you-can proceeds go directly toward The COT’s educational programming.
