SUMMARY:Seafood Omakase at Dashi in Downtown Durham
DESCRIPTION:We’re diving into a seafood-forward menu that highlights the balance between light\, bright flavors and deeper\, savory notes. Expect a progression that moves from delicate raw preparations into dishes with a little more richness—citrus\, gentle heat\, and umami layered throughout. It’s a thoughtful lineup that captures the range of the ocean\, with a refreshing\, citrusy finish to close things out 🍋✨ \nReservations available at our Downtown Durham izakaya at www.dashiramen.com/omakase.\n$75 five course dinner + $35 pairings \nSeafood | Japanese Restaurant in Durham\, NC | Downtown Durham Restaurant | Craft Cocktails | Date Night
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/seafood-omakase-at-dashi-in-downtown-durham/
