SUMMARY:N64 Tournaments
DESCRIPTION:Show off your N64 skills every last Thursday of each month! From 7 – 9pm we’ll be hosting up to 16 players for a sweet bracket tournament. Months alternate between Mario Kart and Super Smash Bros so there’s a place to shine for everyone. First come\, first play so get here early\, grab your drink\, and sign up to play your heart out. Must purchase a beverage to enter tournament\, so come thirsty! \nWe’re starting on May 28th with Super Smash Bros\, everyone’s favorite smash em up game from 1999 with crossover fights from Mario\, Link\, Pikachu\, Donkey Kong\, and more. Knock those opponents out with a cold beer at the ready. \nThen on June 25th\, speed against fellow Jug drinkers at everyone’s favorite 1996 3D kart-racing game\, Mario Kart. The shells can’t get you if you have a cocktail at the ready! \nIt’s on like Donkey Kong every last Thursday – get here early to snag your spot! \nHappens on the following Dates:\nMay 28\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)\nJun 25\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)\nJul 30\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/n64-tournaments/
